          "ShortDescriptionStr": "The Senior Thermal Protection Systems Engineer is a key role within Oceaneering’s Space Systems Division (OSS).  The role combines technical execution, subject matter expertise, and strong customer relationship skills working across the lifecycle of OSS programs from early customer engagement, through proposal preparation, project engineering, manufacturing and delivery.  \n\nOSS executes projects in partnership with Prime Contractors on programs for NASA, Defense and Commercial Aerospace customers. The Senior TPS Engineer will design, develop, test, implement, and perform analysis of technical products and systems associated with TPS, which includes textile (“softgoods”) products, and mechanical/electromechanical hardware products and systems. \n",
